<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Greetings,<br>
<br>
I received the following email from the Landlord in regards to the storage =
unit that I have used since the beginning of my tenancy at 10-585 Corydon A=
ve.<br>
<br>
&quot;Subject: Storage Lockers. Due to renovations starting in the basement=
. Residents are to have their storage lockers completely emptied by the end=
 of the day on Wednesday, January 17th, 2024. We thank you for your co-oper=
ation. Sincerely, Thorwin Properties''
 (dated Monday January 8,2024)<br>
<br>
I have been a tenant at 10-585 Corydon Ave since signing a Standard Residen=
tial Tenancy Agreement with Winpark Dorchester Properties on April 30, 2011=
. I have been using the storage unit located in the basement since the begi=
nning of my tenancy. The storage
 unit # is correlated with my suite #. I have been issued a key that provid=
es access to the storage area as well as the laundry area. All the storage =
units have been associated with their correlated suites on site. Under the =
ownership of Winpark Dorchester
 Properties, each storage unit was labeled with an attached&nbsp;piece of A=
4 paper that clearly indicated the association between the tenant's suite a=
nd storage unit #. These labels have since been removed.<o:p></o:p></p>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Winpark Dorchester Properties sold its property to M=
yPlace Reality which has rebranded as Thorwin Properties.
<br>
<br>
Form 2 (see attached) was not fully completed by Winpark Dorchester Propert=
ies as seen in Section C &quot;Services and Facilities Included in Basic Re=
nt&quot;. Although water, heat, laundry services, storage facilities, and a=
ppliances have been provided since the start
 of the tenancy these boxes have not been checked. This appears to be an ov=
ersight and an error on my part for not being aware that non-completion of =
Form 2 is a serious issue. There is a reasonable expectation that the servi=
ces were included in the Standard
 Residential Tenancy Agreement with Winpark Dorchester Properties as demons=
trated by my continued and uninterrupted use of these services and reiterat=
ed in discussion with Celena Funk, Property Manager at Thorwin Properties.<=
br>
<br>
I have communicated with Thorwin Properties about the issue of the storage =
unit (and the laundry services) and proposal for removal since May 4, 2023.=
 As stated by Property Manager Celena Funk on Friday, May 5, 2023, &quot;Th=
e Mobile Resident Manager was unaware
 that your storage locker had been grandfathered in prior to Thorwin Proper=
ties purchase of the building. Should at any time we decide to remove the s=
torage units we will apply through the Residential Tenancy Branch for a wit=
hdrawal of service.&quot;<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Further communications with Thorwin Properties have =
been ignored until recently and since May 4, 2023 I have been requesting th=
at Thorwin Properties follow legislated protocol.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I feel that it is within my right to continue using =
the storage unit at 585 Corydon Ave and I do not wish to remove my property=
 from the space that I have been provided since the beginning&nbsp;of my te=
nancy. The RTB has not received Form 9
 (Application to Fix Value of Permanent Reduction or Withdrawal of Service)=
 from Thorwin Properties and I have not received Form 8 (Notice to Tenant =
=E2=80=93 Permanent Reduction or Withdrawal of Service (Other than a tenant=
 services reduction or withdrawal)).<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I would like to request an investigation and I would=
 like to know what the consequences of not removing my property from the st=
orage unit on Wednesday, January 7, 2024 entails. What response can I expec=
t from the landlord?<o:p></o:p></p>
